<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml"><body><div>
<p begin="00:05.000" end="00:09.000"><span begin="00:05.000">第一行缺闭合</span>
<p begin="00:10.000" end="00:14.000"><span begin="00:10.000">第二行不应被吞并</span></p>
<p begin="00:15.000" end="00:19.000"><span begin="00:15.000">末行也缺闭合</span>
</div></body></tt>
